Portal (SM8550, mainline msm) sensors for Valve's Steam Frame metrics.

- GPU/memory temperature: look thermal zones up by type instead of the
  Frame's zone numbers (28/26/22 are aoss2/camera0/modem0 here);
  junction temperature is the hottest gpuss zone.
- Fan: pwmfan when the Frame's slg4ax46073v controller is absent.
- GPU clock: first devfreq device named *.gpu.
- Memory total: MemTotal (unified memory) instead of a fixed 16000.
- ftrace GPU memory: without tracefs access, report 0 instead of
  abort()ing the host process; disable events on our instance only.
- Battery: also accept power supplies of type Battery (the Portal's
  pmic_glink battery is named "battery", not BAT*), but not ones with
  scope Device (controller batteries).
---
